    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d378-a3">

                <pb facs="0677" n="607" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg607"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Draft indorsed by Mr. Frelinghuysen and Mr. Bingham as follows:</p>
                <p>Pay to the order of John A. Bingham, envoy extraordinary and minister
                    plenipotentiary of the United States of America in Japan.</p>
                <closer><signed>FRED’K T. FRELINGHUYSEN</signed>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                        Secretary of State of the United States of America.</hi></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Pay to the order of Inouye Kaoru, His Imperial Japanese Majesty’s minister
                        for foreign affairs.</p>
                    <closer><signed>JOHN A. BINGHAM</signed>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Envoy
                            Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of the United States of
                            America in Japan.</hi></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
